    "description": "Tannery, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 252 blocks vs 132. Spruce work shed open on one side to a yard of soaking vats (composters, open barrels); crafting table as workstation, scraping bench; L2 adds a long hide drying rack, lime pits, leather and lanterns; L3 stretching frames, barrels of finished leather, rinse troughs, sign, banner and flowers. Wants level ground. Not yet builder-tested: brown_wall_banner, cauldron, cornflower, dandelion, fern, oxeye_daisy. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, item_frame, sign_text, water_cauldron.",
